<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    ============================================================
    KernelExtensions ProxyKiller 配置示例
    KernelExtensions ProxyKiller Configuration Example
    ============================================================
    定位：一个"看着过载把目标压满"的**展示**程序。
    Position: a *display* program that shows an overload build-up.
    放 <扩展根>/ProxyKiller/ 下。
    Place it under <extensionRoot>/ProxyKiller/.

    启用方式：给玩家挂上存档 flag ProxyKiller_<文件名>（不含 .xml）。
    flag 就是"入口牌"：无 flag 程序锁定；出现多个 flag 视为作者配置错误（锁定 + 日志报错）。
    然后在终端执行 #PROXYKILLER#。
    How to enable: set the save flag ProxyKiller_<fileName> (without .xml) on the player.
    The flag is the entry token: none means locked; more than one is an authoring error.
    Then run #PROXYKILLER# in the terminal.

    它做什么：按配置把 RAM 从起始值线性爬到目标值，同时用一个背景动画把这个过程表达出来
    （粒子由混沌趋于整齐），右下角一个退出按钮。界面上**不显示任何文字与数字** ——
    爬升本身看得见，再叠读数就是噪声。
    What it does: ramps RAM linearly from a start value to a target while a background effect
    expresses that build-up (the dots settle as it climbs), plus an Exit button. No text or
    numbers are drawn: the build-up is visible on its own.

    ⚠️ 过载倍率是**扩展作者在配置里定义的**，本程序不调任何东西、也不碰目标机
    （它不调用 hostileActionTaken，不算入侵行为）。
    The overload multiplier is defined by the extension author in configuration; this program
    changes nothing and touches no target (it never calls hostileActionTaken).
-->
<ProxyKillerConfig>

  <!-- ── 程序名 / Program name ──
       终端与窗口顶部显示的名字。留空 = ProxyKiller。
       Name shown in the terminal and the window title. Empty = ProxyKiller.
       程序在终端里的注册名 #PROXYKILLER# 不受此处影响。
       The registration name #PROXYKILLER# is not affected by this. -->
  <ProgramName>ProxyKiller</ProgramName>

  <!-- ── RAM 爬升 / RAM ramp ──
       启动时按 <RamCost> 占用，然后以 <RampRate> 的速率爬到 <BurstTarget>。
       Starts at <RamCost>, then climbs to <BurstTarget> at <RampRate>.
       这三个值默认对齐原版 SignalScramble（原版 DLCTraceSlower）：
       50 → 600MB，200MB/s（约 2.75 秒爬满）。
       Defaults mirror vanilla SignalScramble (DLCTraceSlower): 50 -> 600MB at 200MB/s.

       BurstTarget：爬升目标（MB）。留空 = 600。目标小于起始值时按"不爬升"处理。
                    Ramp target in MB. Empty = 600. If below the start, no ramp happens.
       RamCost    ：启动时的占用（MB）。留空 = 50。
                    Starting RAM in MB. Empty = 50.
       RampRate   ：爬升速率（MB/s）。留空 = 200；写 0 = 只占起始值不爬。
                    Ramp speed in MB/s. Empty = 200; 0 means "stay at the start value". -->
  <BurstTarget>600</BurstTarget>
  <RamCost>50</RamCost>
  <RampRate>200</RampRate>

  <!-- ── shell 过载倍速 / Shell overload speed ──
       ⚠️ 本程序**自己不瘫痪任何代理** —— 它只加速**正在过载的所有 Shell**，
       不区分那些 shell 各自对着哪个节点。
       This program never overloads a proxy itself. It only speeds up every Shell that is
       currently overloading a proxy — regardless of which node each one targets.
       shell 分布运行在多个节点上（每个 shell 的 targetIP 是它创建时所连的那台，之后不变），
       所以你在几台上开了 shell 并让它们过载，本程序就同时加速那几个。
       Shells live on different nodes, so if you opened several and set them overloading,
       all of them get accelerated at once.
       原版要先在目标机上拿到 admin 才能开 shell —— 那道门槛本程序不去拆
       （没有 shell 在过载时，这一项不产生任何效果）。
       Vanilla requires admin on each target to open a shell; that gate is left intact
       (with nothing overloading, this setting does nothing).
       N 个 shell 的总速率 = N × 倍速（原版多 shell 本来就是简单叠加）。

       倍速不是一次性跳到目标，而是由 RAM 爬升**线性驱动**：
       倍速 1 → ProxyOverloadTarget  对应  RamCost → BurstTarget（两者共用同一个进度）。
       The multiplier is not applied in one jump: it is driven linearly by the RAM ramp —
       speed 1 -> ProxyOverloadTarget corresponds to RamCost -> BurstTarget.
       好处是"占的内存越多、加速越强"两个数字能互相印证（这也正是原版 SignalScramble
       把 ramCost 映射到 trace 减速系数的做法，只是换成加速 shell 过载）。
       The two numbers corroborate each other, mirroring how vanilla SignalScramble maps
       ramCost onto its trace-slowdown factor.
       1.0 = 原版过载速度（不加速）；2.0 = 两倍。留空 = 1.0。
       1.0 = vanilla overload speed; 2.0 = double. Empty = 1.0.
       倍速峰值恰好等于这里填的值（RAM 爬满那一刻）；RampRate 越小，低倍速停留越久。
       The peak multiplier equals this value (reached when RAM tops out); a smaller RampRate
       means it lingers at low multipliers longer. -->
  <ProxyOverloadTarget>1.0</ProxyOverloadTarget>

  <!-- ── 强调色 / Accent color ──
       背景粒子与退出按钮的颜色。留空 / NONE = 白色。
       Colour of the background dots and the exit button. Empty or NONE = white.
       支持 CustomColor 预设名与动态色（LDTchara / Rainbow / Gradient:…），
       以及 #RGB / #RRGGBB / #AARRGGBB / R,G,B[,A] / XNA 命名色。
       Accepts CustomColor preset names and dynamic colours, hex, numeric RGB(A) and XNA names.
       动态色逐帧刷新。
       Dynamic colours refresh every frame. -->
  <AccentColor>White</AccentColor>

  <!-- ── 背景效果 / Background effect ──
       面板背景用的游戏本体现成效果（都不需要自带资源）：
       The background uses the game's built-in effects (no bundled assets needed):
         NONE            不画背景 / no background
         DepthDotGrid    多层递归点阵（原版 SignalScramble 用的）— 默认
                         recursive dot grid with depth (vanilla SignalScramble's choice) — default
         ZoomingDotGrid  中心向外扩散旋转的点阵（PhaseSwift 用的）
                         expanding dot grid from the centre (the one PhaseSwift uses)
         HexGrid         六边形蜂窝网格（原版 KaguyaTrial 用的）
                         hexagonal honeycomb grid (vanilla KaguyaTrial's background)
         Grid            带十字标记的交叉网格 / cross-hatched grid
       留空 = DepthDotGrid；写别的值 → 记 Warn 并回退 DepthDotGrid。
       Empty = DepthDotGrid; any other value logs a warning and falls back to it.
       粒子的"混沌度"随 RAM 爬升从 1 降到 0 —— 这就是整套视觉表达。
       The dot chaos factor falls from 1 to 0 as RAM climbs; that is the whole visual. -->
  <BackgroundEffect>DepthDotGrid</BackgroundEffect>

  <!-- ── 离开节点 / Leaving the node ──
       玩家离开本程序所在节点时是否自动关闭。留空 = true
       （对齐原版 SignalScramble：它跟着所连节点走，断连即退）。
       Whether to close when the player leaves the node this program runs on. Empty = true
       (matching vanilla SignalScramble, which follows the connected node). -->
  <ExitOnDisconnect>true</ExitOnDisconnect>

</ProxyKillerConfig>

<!--
    ============================================================
    变体 / Variants（把对应行放进上面的根元素）
    Variants (put the line into the root element above)
    ============================================================

    [爬得慢一点，看清粒子变化 / A slower ramp so the dots can be watched]
      <RampRate>50</RampRate>

    [真的去加速代理过载：峰值两倍速 / Actually speed the overload up: peak x2]
      <ProxyOverloadTarget>2.0</ProxyOverloadTarget>

    [慢速压满：长时间停在低倍速 / A slow squeeze: lingers at low multipliers]
      <RampRate>40</RampRate>
      <ProxyOverloadTarget>3.0</ProxyOverloadTarget>

    [只展示，不碰目标机 / Display only, leave the target alone]
      省略 <ProxyOverloadTarget>（等价于 1.0 = 原版速度）
      Omit it (same as 1.0 = vanilla speed)

    [慢慢吞掉 2GB / Slowly swallow 2GB]
      <RamCost>50</RamCost>
      <BurstTarget>2048</BurstTarget>
      <RampRate>80</RampRate>

    [只占起始值，完全不爬 / Stay at the start value, no ramp at all]
      <RampRate>0</RampRate>

    [不留驻：走开节点就关 / Exit when leaving the node]
      <ExitOnDisconnect>true</ExitOnDisconnect>

    [改成留驻（走开也不关）/ Keep running when leaving the node]
      <ExitOnDisconnect>false</ExitOnDisconnect>

    [换个背景，改用主题色 / Another background, using the theme colour]
      删掉 <AccentColor> / Remove <AccentColor>
      <BackgroundEffect>HexGrid</BackgroundEffect>

    [不用背景，只看按钮 / No background, just the button]
      <BackgroundEffect>NONE</BackgroundEffect>
-->
